    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100949" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντᾰλαιπωρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>endure hardships together, share
				in misery</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1136
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. μετά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					1221
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. ἡ ἀρτηρίη τῷ στομάχῳ</span>
			<i>suffers</i> or <i>sympathizes with</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
